entries[236960] = { ["name"] = "Prototype A.S.M.R.", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nUse: Teaches you how to summon this mount. This mount changes depending on your Riding skill and location.\nSummons and dismisses this mount.\nRequires level 1 to 90 ( 90)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\n\"Representing the pinnacle of goblin propaganda technology, Gallywix commissioned the Automatic Sonic Machine Resonator to sway his most stubborn critics.\"\nDrop:\nChrome King Gallywix\nZone:\nLiberation of Undermine" }
